# Deploys were failing with Vercel-side 500s because the upload carried ~260MB of media the site
# never serves (docs gifs, capture frames, judge artifacts, episode masters). The site needs only
# source + public/. Root-caused 2026-06-10; see docs/dogfood/FRICTION_LOG.md.
docs
!docs/eval/
docs/eval/three-user-shots
docs/eval/gemini-media-judges
docs/eval/walkthrough-review
docs/eval/workflow-previews
docs/eval/halo-runs
docs/eval/live-browser-proofs
docs/eval/traces
docs/eval/ui-recordings
docs/eval/gif-judge
docs/eval/spreadsheetbench-chart-visual
docs/eval/retrieval
docs/eval/agent-improvement-loop
docs/eval/design-quality
docs/eval/finance-model-runs
# Belt-and-suspenders: never ship media under docs/ regardless of subdir re-includes
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.gif
docs/**/*.mp4
docs/**/*.mov
docs/**/*.webm
# Keep the nonbtb rubric tree shipping (37KB total) — benchmarkDispatcher.ts globs it
# via import.meta.glob at build time. Without this, Vite resolves the glob to {} on Vercel
# and the dispatcher silently ships zero tasks.
!docs/eval/nonbtb
!docs/eval/nonbtb/**
episodes
remotion
e2e
tests
evals
demo
scripts
.tmp-qa
*.log
# Episode videos are gitignored (repo stays lean) but MUST deploy — they are served at
# noderoom.live/episodes/*.mp4. The ! re-includes them for the upload.
!public/episodes
!public/episodes/**
